{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2023-06-26 18:00:00', 'title': "LILLY'S PHASE 2 RETATRUTIDE RESULTS PUBLISHED IN THE NEW ENGLAND JOURNAL OF MEDICINE SHOW THE INVESTIGATIONAL MOLECULE ACHIEVED UP TO 17.5% MEAN WEIGHT REDUCTION AT 24 WEEKS IN ADULTS WITH OBESITY AND OVERWEIGHT", 'text': "IN A SECONDARY ENDPOINT, RETATRUTIDE DEMONSTRATED A MEAN WEIGHT REDUCTION UP TO 24.2% AT 48 WEEKS LILLY TO FURTHER INVESTIGATE RETATRUTIDE\xa0FOR\xa0THE TREATMENT OF OBESITY\xa0IN THE TRIUMPH PHASE 3 CLINICAL PROGRAM INDIANAPOLIS , JUNE 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) ANNOUNCED TODAY NEW PHASE 2 DATA\xa0FROM RETATRUTIDE, LILLY'S INVESTIGATIONAL MOLECULE BEING STUDIED FOR THE TREATMENT OF OBESITY. AT 24 WEEKS, RETATRUTIDE (1 MG, 4 MG, 8 MG OR 12 MG)\xa0MET THE PRIMARY ENDPOINT FOR THE EFFICACY ESTIMAND IN PARTICIPANTS LIVING WITH OBESITY OR OVERWEIGHTI WITHOUT DIABETES, DEMONSTRATING A MEAN WEIGHT REDUCTION UP TO 17.5% (41.2 LB."}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2023-06-26 11:06:00', 'title': 'LILLY DECLARES THIRD-QUARTER 2023 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS , JUNE 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE:\xa0LLY) HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2023 OF\xa0$1.13\xa0PER SHARE ON OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON\xa0SEPT.'}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2023-06-24 11:18:00', 'title': "LILLY'S SURMOUNT-2 RESULTS PUBLISHED IN THE LANCET SHOW TIRZEPATIDE ACHIEVED A MEAN WEIGHT REDUCTION OF 15.7% AT THE HIGHEST DOSE (15 MG) IN ADULTS WITH OBESITY OR OVERWEIGHT AND TYPE 2 DIABETES", 'text': "DETAILED RESULTS PRESENTED AT THE AMERICAN DIABETES ASSOCIATION'S® 83RD SCIENTIFIC SESSIONS\xa0 LILLY HAS COMPLETED TIRZEPATIDE'S SUBMISSION FOR CHRONIC WEIGHT MANAGEMENT TO THE FDA INDIANAPOLIS , JUNE 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DETAILED RESULTS FROM SURMOUNT-2, A PHASE 3 CLINICAL TRIAL EVALUATING THE EFFICACY AND SAFETY OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY'S (NYSE:\xa0LLY) TIRZEPATIDE (10 MG AND 15 MG) FOR CHRONIC WEIGHT MANAGEMENT IN PARTICIPANTS WITH OBESITY OR OVERWEIGHTI AND TYPE 2 DIABETES, SHOWED THAT TIRZEPATIDE LED TO SUPERIOR WEIGHT REDUCTION VERSUS PLACEBO FOR BOTH DOSES. THE DATA WERE PRESENTED DURING A SYMPOSIUM AT THE AMERICAN DIABETES ASSOCIATION'S® (ADA) 83RD SCIENTIFIC SESSIONS AND WERE SIMULTANEOUSLY PUBLISHED IN THE LANCET."}